            "line": 133,
            "text": "theorem omega_axisFactor (h : ℝ) (U v : ℕ → InnerProfile) (k : ℕ) (w : InnerPoint)\n    (hv : ∀ j, j ≤ k → ContDiffAt ℝ 2 (v j) w) (hL : L h w.2 ≠ 0) :\n    omega h U (fun j => axisFactor (v j)) k w = w.1 * omegaDivX h U v k w"
